            "
          >
            Long story short
          </h2>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
  padding="14px 12px 0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 1px;
    "
  >
    Global Affairs
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Canadian PM Mark Carney called US-Israeli strikes on Iran a failure of the international order, urging rapid de-escalation and renewed diplomacy. </strong>He said Iran remains a source of regional instability and has not curbed its nuclear program despite years of negotiations. Carney backed efforts to prevent nuclear proliferation while stressing civilian protection and broader political solutions (<a href="https://thehill.com/policy/international/5766143-canada-iran-nuclear-threat/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">Canada urges de-escalation</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>European allies are deploying warships, anti-drone systems, and jets to Cyprus after a drone struck RAF Akrotiri</strong> over the weekend amid US-Israeli strikes on Iran. The UK sends HMS Dragon and helicopters; France dispatches frigate Languedoc; Greece provides F-16s and frigates. Britain said its jets downed an Iranian drone over Jordan. Cyprus insists it is not involved in the conflict, amid scrutiny over base security (<a href="https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c4g74npdwnyo" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">allies bolster Cyprus</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Business &amp; Markets
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>US financial firms are on heightened alert for potential Iran-linked cyberattacks as conflict escalates in the Middle East. </strong>Executives warn of possible low-level disruptions, including DDoS attacks by pro-Iranian hacktivists targeting critical infrastructure such as payments and trading systems. Analysts say indirect risks, including higher oil prices, also loom, while agencies caution Tehran could expand cyber operations against Western banks (<a href="https://www.timesofisrael.com/liveblog_entry/us-banks-on-high-alert-for-cyberattacks-as-iran-war-escalates/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">cyber threat alert</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>OpenAI is developing a code-hosting platform to rival ​Microsoft's GitHub. </strong>The move follows recent service disruptions affecting engineers. The early-stage product may eventually be offered to OpenAI customers, though completion is months away. If launched, it would pit OpenAI against its major backer, Microsoft (<a href="https://www.thehindu.com/sci-tech/technology/openai-is-developing-alternative-to-microsofts-github-report/article70701898.ece" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">code hosting challenge</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>US defense contractors, including Lockheed Martin, are expected to remove Anthropic tools after President Trump ordered a Pentagon-wide ban</strong>. The administration plans to label Anthropic a national security supply chain risk. Lawyers say contractors will likely comply to protect federal contracts, even as Anthropic prepares to challenge the decision in court (<a href="https://www.storyboard18.com/brand-makers/us-defense-contractors-including-lockheed-likely-to-drop-anthropic-ai-after-trump-ban-91199.htm" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">contractors ditch Anthropic</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Science &amp; Tech
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-image
  border-radius="10px"
  padding="0px 12px 10px 12px"
  width="600px"
  src="https://www.presidentialsummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
  alt="Science &amp; Tech"
  href="https://www.presidentialsummary.com/"
/>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Astronomers using the Hubble, Euclid, and Subaru telescopes have identified Candidate Dark Galaxy-2 (CDG-2).</strong> It is an ultra-faint galaxy about 300Mn light-years away that may consist of 99.9% dark matter, orbiting globular clusters in the Perseus Cluster. Likely stripped of star-forming gas. It represents an "almost-dark galaxy," providing insights into dark matter behavior (<a href="https://edition.cnn.com/2026/03/03/science/nasa-hubble-galaxy-dark-matter" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">dark galaxy</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Anthropic has launched Voice Mode for Claude Code, introducing hands-free coding via spoken commands. </strong>Users can toggle it with "/voice," then issue instructions like "refactor the authentication middleware," which the AI coding assistant executes seamlessly. Live for 5% of users with a broader rollout ahead, it enhances conversational workflows for developers. This builds on Claude's existing voice capabilities, streamlining interactions without keyboard input (<a href="https://techcrunch.com/2026/03/03/claude-code-rolls-out-a-voice-mode-capability/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">Claude gets voice</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Whatnot
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
